      "content": "i'm still a little nervous about it tbh. my coworker said that mixing those kinds of meds can cause bleeding if you already have stomach issues, and with these sharp pains, i'm worried i might have a hole or an ulcer already. but i really can't afford a doctor visit right now and i need the ibuprofen to deal with this tooth. if i just take the ibuprofen with the omeprazole and the magnesium you suggested, can i just stay home and manage this myself? i'll be fine as long as i keep up with the meds, right?",
